   40: | `submission_id` | uuid, primary key | The submission's id. Deliberately **no foreign key**, so the row can be written before the submission row (Â§3.3). |
   41: | `token_hash` | text, not null | SHA-256 (hex) of the random token. The token itself is never stored. |
