   40: Verified as correct:
   41: 
   42: - No RLS or grant change is needed. `submissions` has RLS enabled ([schema.sql:134](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/supabase/schema.sql:134)); `anon` and `authenticated` are revoked by default ([schema.sql:140](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/supabase/schema.sql:140)); authenticated users receive only `status` and `updated_at` update grants ([schema.sql:151](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/supabase/schema.sql:151)); and the update policy is admin-gated ([schema.sql:183](C:/Users/yerie/m3-memory/supabase/schema.sql:183)). The service role bypasses these controls, so application-side narrowing is the decisive boundary.
